{"title":"Z-test","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>A z-test is a significance test in statistics that one conducts when the population standard deviation is known. Since the population standard deviation is usually unknown, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=T-tests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"T-tests\">t-tests</a> are more common. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Procedure\">Procedure</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Z-test&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Procedure\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Step_1:_Name_hypotheses\">Step 1: Name hypotheses</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Z-test&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Step 1: Name hypotheses\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>Name the significance level and the side of the test(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/8/198c2ccab4aa56b5add5589ea42b5a5073829513.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H_a&gt;H_0, H_a&lt;H-0, H_a\\ne H_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"250\" height=\"17\" />)\nThese should be named before the data is gathered.\n</p>\n<h4><span id=\"Step_2:_State_conditions.2Fassumptions\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Step_2:_State_conditions/assumptions\">Step 2: State conditions/assumptions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Z-test&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Step 2: State conditions/assumptions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h4>\n<p>The population must be normal\n</p><p>Unfinished page\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018114416\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 15/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 205/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14607:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018114416 and revision id 75838. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}